<ans># Niva Bupa Health Insurance Ltd — H1FY25 Financial Data Extraction

Based on a direct review of the statutory documents filed by Niva Bupa Health Insurance Ltd, here are the figures extracted for the six months ended September 30, 2024 (H1FY25).

